{"parentUuid":"2006f1e1-b5c3-4dce-a1e2-66cd88b53ba5","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14995895 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"e495250d-79de-4fc7-8d43-094629dedf0d","timestamp":"2026-09-16T09:36:36.376Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14995895 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"b948f157-4213-4e56-bd64-c9eb07cc152a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
{"parentUuid":"e495250d-79de-4fc7-8d43-094629dedf0d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf6tioPkqC8GhkEWN6Cju","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the visual result, on the app's dark stage — old model, bare u2netp, and what ships (sharpened):\n\n**The chain** — the win. Bare u2netp filled the loop with a dark smear; the shipped version is clean, the loop is open. The chain itself is a touch thicker than the old model's (the 320 px mask blurred up), which is what the remaining 0.80 measures — but on the stage it reads as a chain, not a blob.\n\n**The trousers** — the honest loss. The light wedge between the legs is there in both of ours; only the old model got it right. That's the model being confidently wrong, and no post-processing touched it.\n\n**The white sneaker** — the old model hollowed it out into a black-and-blue outline; ours is the whole shoe.\n\n**Shirt, polo** — indistinguishable from the old model.\n\n**The Kilian bottle** — the old model kept the clear glass base as a solid light block; ours cut the glass as transparent. Neither is obviously wrong; a product photographer would side with the old one.\n\nSo the trade you're shipping: white garments right, thin metal nearly right, one failure mode on background-coloured gaps between limbs — and 85 MB less on first run. The full sheet is in `scratch/result-sheet.png` if you want it larger."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_read_input_tokens":916153,"output_tokens":416,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":416,"cache_read_input_tokens":916153,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1588,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1588},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf6tifDs6hJQkAbjrJZzS","type":"assistant","uuid":"9adc036a-0531-4c12-ac54-8af25416aa75","timestamp":"2026-09-16T09:36:47.422Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"b948f157-4213-4e56-bd64-c9eb07cc152a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
