{"parentUuid":"5a37660f-dccd-4821-ae64-f793a51b5378","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf6ui8DB7ZAiUuXN4aufV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fruw1sFt9GD3cXFkvnPz4P","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck\nmkdir -p scratch/models\ncurl -sL \"https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/BiRefNet_lite-ONNX/resolve/main/onnx/model_fp16.onnx\" -o scratch/models/birefnet_lite_fp16.onnx\nls -la scratch/models/birefnet_lite_fp16.onnx | awk '{printf \"%.1f MB\\n\", $5/1e6}'\npython3 - <<'PY'\n# BiRefNet emits LOGITS; u2netp emits a sigmoid. Make the activation part of the model description.\np='lib/images/segment.ts'; s=open(p).read()\nold='''export type SegmentModel = {\n  url: string;\n  inputSize: number;\n  mean: readonly [number, number, number];\n  std: readonly [number, number, number];\n};'''\nnew='''export type SegmentModel = {\n  url: string;\n  inputSize: number;\n  mean: readonly [number, number, number];\n  std: readonly [number, number, number];\n  /** What the first output is. u2netp already applied a sigmoid; BiRefNet emits logits. */\n  output?: \"probability\" | \"logits\";\n};'''\nassert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)\nold2='''  let mask = minMaxNormalise(raw.subarray(0, n * n));'''\nnew2='''  const plane = raw.subarray(0, n * n);\n  let mask: Float32Array;\n  if (model.output === \"logits\") {\n    mask = new Float32Array(n * n);\n    for (let i = 0; i < mask.length; i++) mask[i] = 1 / (1 + Math.exp(-plane[i]));\n  } else {\n    mask = minMaxNormalise(plane);\n  }'''\nassert s.count(old2)==1; s=s.replace(old2,new2)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\nnpx tsc --noEmit 2>&1 | head -2; npx vitest run lib/images 2>&1 | grep -E \"Tests |×\"\ntime (REFINE='{}' node scripts/cutout-harness/run.mjs \"05.46.26\" 2>&1 | grep -v \"^npm warn\\|^\\s*at \" | grep -iE \"IoU|error\" | head -3)","description":"Download BiRefNet_lite; add a logits output option; 