ool:\n1\tMUTATION                               CAUGHT BY\n2\tR and B channels swapped               unit:1   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n3\tNHWC instead of NCHW                   unit:1   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n4\tno normalisation                       unit:1   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n5\twrong side output (d6 not d0)          unit:0   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n6\tmin-max normalise skipped              unit:0   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n7\tmask not written to alpha              unit:0   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n8\tmask inverted                          unit:0   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n9\tnearest-neighbour mask upscale         unit:0   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n10\tsession not cached                     unit:0   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n11\tIoU thresholded, not soft              unit:1   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n12\tflat mask → NaN                        unit:1   harness IoU:crash (was 0.9848)\n13\t\n14\t[exited with code 0]\n15\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"b948f157-4213-4e56-bd64-c9eb07cc152a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
{"parentUuid":"437ad7ca-aa06-4eca-b235-f0c36e16ca96","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"file","filename":"/Users/1curafu/.claude/projects/-Users-1curafu-Desktop-Fitcheck-Fitcheck/memory/no-merge-without-permission.md","content":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/1curafu/.claude/projects/-Users-1curafu-Desktop-Fitcheck-Fitcheck/memory/no-merge-without-permission.md","content":"---\nname: no-merge-without-permission\ndescription: \"Never merge a PR (or push to main) without an explicit go from the user in that moment; \\\"looks good\\\" is not \\\"merge\\\"\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: 8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172\n  modified: 2026-09-14T21:56:34.376Z\n---\n\nNever run `gh pr merge` or push to `main` unless the user explicitly says to merge/ship, in the\ncurrent exchange. Approval of the *work* (\"okay its good\") is not approval to *merge*.\n\n**Why:** On 2026-09-14 I merged PR #76 after the user said the layout was good, without them\nsaying merge. They then said: \"did u made a full review of that function, dont merge without my\npermission.\" They also want a full review reported before a merge is even proposed — a review\nthat turned up an unanchored constant (`PLAIN` in bag.ts) that decided product behaviour.\n\n**How to apply:** Open the PR, report the review honestly (including anything unanchored or\nunverified), and stop. Wait for \"merge\" / \"ship\" / \"go\" on that specific PR. Earlier \"can u do it\nall\" delegation (2026-09-10) covered the 0.2.0 release flow, not a standing licence to merge.\nRelated: [[hand-off-pr-creation]], [[full-branch-review-before-pr]].\n","numLines":23,"startLine":1,"totalLines":23}},"displayPath":"../../../.claude/projects/-Users-1curafu-Desktop-Fitcheck-Fitcheck/memory/no-merge-without-permission.md"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2e63a2c6-3674-48c7-9e60-5cf81c3ef944","timestamp":"2026-09-16T10:14:41.744Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/Users/1curafu/.claude/projects/-Users-1curafu-Desktop-Fitcheck-Fitcheck/memory/no-merge-without-permission.md\"}\n</system-reminder>"},{"content":"<system-reminder>\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t---\n2\tname: no-merge-without-permission\n3\tdescription: \"Never merge a PR (or push to main) without an explicit go from the user in that moment; \\\"looks good\\\" is not \\\"merge\\\"\"\n4\tmetadata: \n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: feedback\n7\t  originSessionId: 8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172\n8\t  modified: 2026-09-14T21:56:34.376Z\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\tNever run `gh pr merge` or push to `main` unless the user explicitly says to merge/ship, in the\n12\tcurrent exchange. Approval of the *work* (\"okay its good\") is not approval to *merge*.\n13\t\n14\t**Why:** On 2026-09-14 I merged PR #76 after the user said the layout was good, without them\n15\tsaying merge. They then said: \"did u made a full review of that function, dont merge without my\n16\tpermission.\" They also want a full review reported before a merge is even proposed — a review\n17\tthat turned up an unanchored constant (`PLAIN` in bag.ts) that decided product behaviour.\n18\t\n19\t**How to apply:** Open the PR, report the review honestly (including anything unanchored or\n20\tunverified), and stop. Wait for \"merge\" / \"ship\" / \"go\" on that specific PR. Earlier \"can u do it\n21\tall\" delegation (2026-09-10) covered the 0.2.0 release flow, not a standing licence to merge.\n22\tRelated: [[hand-off-pr-creation]], [[full-branch-review-before-pr]].\n23\t\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"b948f157-4213-4e56-bd64-c9eb07cc152a","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
