{"parentUuid":"d277eed9-5249-4527-9558-4ad408cd8aec","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"SessionStart:compact","toolUseID":"9f714169-873b-4719-a68c-b475e776d517","hookEvent":"SessionStart","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"SessionStart\",\"additionalContext\":\"# $CMEM Fitcheck 2026-09-16 12:14pm GMT+2\\n\\nLegend: 🎯session 🔴bugfix 🟣feature 🔄refactor ✅change 🔵discovery ⚖️decision\\nFormat: ID TIME TYPE TITLE\\nFetch details: get_observations([IDs]) | Search: mem-search skill\\n\\nStats: 50 obs (18,121t read) | 113,127t work | 84% savings\\n\\n### Sep 16, 2026\\n4688 6:16a 🔵 Backup tooling and credentials assessment\\n4689 6:17a ⚖️ Cutout model refinement strategy documented\\n4690 6:18a 🔵 Legal link insertion points identified in profile and onboarding\\n4691 \\\" ✅ Tests added for legal link visibility requirements\\n4692 6:19a 🔴 Quiz test fixed to correctly identify and click buttons\\n4693 6:27a 🔵 AI outfit generator lacks attention to color and material detail coordination\\n4694 6:28a ✅ Updated roadmap and project state to reflect recent completions\\n4695 6:32a 🟣 Age self-declaration added to onboarding quiz agreement\\n4696 7:49a ✅ Google OAuth consent screen production requirement added to roadmap\\n4697 8:18a ✅ Roadmap updated with subscription management requirements\\nS981 Complete Stripe activation review for subscription billing with monthly and annual pricing (Sep 16 at 8:19 AM)\\nS982 Configure Stripe statement descriptors for subscription billing activation (Sep 16 at 8:21 AM)\\nS983 Resolve banking requirements for Stripe activation while maintaining Swiss legal framework (Sep 16 at 8:22 AM)\\nS984 Configure Wise Business account for receiving Stripe subscription payouts (Sep 16 at 8:24 AM)\\nS985 Select correct industry category for business account receiving subscription revenue (Sep 16 at 8:28 AM)\\nS986 Provide business description for banking account compliance review (Sep 16 at 8:29 AM)\\nS987 Determine correct Wise account tier for receiving Stripe bank transfer payouts (Sep 16 at 8:30 AM)\\nS988 Select optimal Swiss neobank for receiving Stripe subscription payouts as sole proprietor (Sep 16 at 8:32 AM)\\nS989 Confirm and finalize banking account choice for Stripe subscription payouts (Sep 16 at 8:34 AM)\\n4698 8:57a 🟣 Background removal infrastructure setup with ONNX Runtime 1.21.0\\n4699 8:58a 🔵 ONNX Runtime Web 1.21.0 missing expected distribution file\\n4700 8:59a 🔴 Fixed ONNX Runtime Web installation with complete distribution files\\n4701 9:00a 🔵 Background removal harness hits 404 error and 60-second timeout\\n4702 \\\" 🔵 Custom harness works but ImgLy integration fails on module path resolution\\n4703 9:02a 🟣 Background removal system operational with 34 baseline images generated\\n4704 9:03a 🟣 Custom reference override system for visually-correct background removal validation\\n4705 \\\" 🔵 Alpha channel analysis reveals model confidence patterns in segmentation errors\\n4706 9:04a 🟣 Implemented mask refinement algorithms for uncertain and confidently-wrong segmentation errors\\n4707 9:05a 🟣 Integrated mask refinement pipeline into segmentation API with environment-controlled testing\\n4708 11:21a 🔴 Fixed missing refine module in cutout harness build pipeline\\n4709 11:23a 🔴 Fixed false regression detection for self-referenced mask refinements\\n4710 11:25a 🟣 Implemented zoom refinement pass for higher-resolution object details\\n4711 11:26a 🔵 Zoom refinement shows quality gains but maskBounds test reveals implementation bug\\n4712 \\\" 🔴 Fixed maskBounds test import to use ES module syntax\\n4713 11:28a 🟣 Added square crop option to prevent aspect ratio distortion in zoom refinement\\n4714 11:30a 🔵 Three-stage refinement comparison shows progressive quality improvements\\n4715 \\\" ✅ Deployed refinement pipeline as default with updated reference baseline\\n4716 11:31a 🔵 Mutation testing reveals refinement pipeline test coverage 