{"parentUuid":"0cd94cf3-e439-49ce-950d-3a62ac93f50d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14985795 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c2239d4a-dc64-49de-ba2b-bc1f5cc94fdf","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:01:37.847Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14985795 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
{"parentUuid":"c2239d4a-dc64-49de-ba2b-bc1f5cc94fdf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf7Q5d4MVLYJhGrgRQuDX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Full bake-off, all 34 photos, same reference for every model:\n\n| Model | Licence | Weights | under 0.98 | mean | worst |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| @imgly ISNet (old) | AGPL ✗ | 88 MB | — (it *is* the reference on 31/34) | | |\n| **u2netp (shipped)** | Apache-2 | 4.6 MB | 10 | 0.972 | 0.801 |\n| U²-Net full | Apache-2 | 170 MB | 8 | 0.949 | **0.170** (kills the Angels' Share bottle) |\n| **BiRefNet lite** | MIT | 115 MB fp16 | 7 | 0.979 | 0.827 |\n| **BiRefNet** | MIT | ~420 MB | 7 | **0.982** | **0.864** |\n| BiRefNet matting | MIT | ~840 MB | 8 | 0.964 | 0.542 |\n| SAM 2.1 tiny / small / base+ | Apache-2 | 150–300 MB | 25 / 20 / 13 | 0.948–0.958 | 0.59–0.77 |\n\nNot tested:\n- **RMBG-2.0 / 1.4** — gated on Hugging Face (you must log in and accept Bria's terms), and the licence is **non-commercial** anyway, so it can't ship. If you still want to see it, log in at huggingface.co/briaai/RMBG-2.0, run `huggingface-cli login`, and I'll rerun.\n- **BiRefNet HR (2K)** — ~3 min per image even on this Mac; not a phone model. Killed.\n\nWhat the photos say:\n- **Row 2 (Angels' Share bottle)** is the separator: BiRefNet is the only one that keeps the glass clean *and* the gold; u2netp bleeds, lite loses the bottom, matting/SAM hollow it out, U²-Net full keeps only the label.\n- **Chain (row 1)**: BiRefNet 0.864 vs u2netp 0.801 — visibly finer links, no gaps.\n- **Blue AJ1 (row 4)**: every new model ≈ 0.94 vs imgly 0.989 — the old model wins that one; nothing I tested matches it.\n- On plain garments (30 of 34) they're all within 0.01 — you won't see it.\n\nMy read: **BiRefNet lite is the realistic upgrade** — same \"under bar\" count as full, 4× smaller, MIT. Full BiRefNet is ~0.3 % better on average and only visibly better on the bottle; 420 MB is not a phone download. The catch stays the same as before: lite needs **WebGPU** in the browser (WASM OOMs at 1024) — that's iOS 17+/recent Android, with u2netp kept as the fallback. Say which one and I'll build the WebGPU path."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":486,"cache_read_input_tokens":116475,"output_tokens":966,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":486,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":966,"cache_read_input_tokens":116475,"cache_creation_input_tokens":486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":486},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf7Q5ZaFbKBox21BxQoPg","type":"assistant","uuid":"0de4ea7d-f91b-4c98-ad09-e82570540f3a","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:01:52.580Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
