{"parentUuid":"07fa0d7c-b029-4e3f-9be8-cb7328ff6ff7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4236be89-a222-44d3-864f-75c76b867d88","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ErphfQE9i9jUhAfjx6QNAe","type":"tool_result","content":"# Open Background Removal Models Summary\n\nBased on the webpage content, here are the open models listed:\n\n| Model | License | Details |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| **withoutBG Open Weights** | Apache-2.0 | Self-host via Python, Docker, or Mac. Eval card and comparison data available. |\n| **U²-Net** | Apache-2.0 | \"Classic salient-object / background-removal network. Default model in many rembg setups.\" |\n| **U²-NetP** | Apache-2.0 | Lightweight variant described as optimized \"for faster CPU inference.\" |\n| **Silueta** | Apache-2.0 | \"Compact silhouette-oriented model shipped with rembg.\" |\n| **IS-Net (general use)** | Apache-2.0 | \"High-resolution dichotomous image segmentation model (DIS / IS-Net) for general cutouts.\" |\n| **BiRefNet General** | MIT | \"Bilateral Reference Network for high-quality dichotomous segmentation / matting-style cutouts.\" |\n| **BiRefNet General Lite** | MIT | Lighter checkpoint variant for enhanced speed. |\n| **BRIA RMBG** | Custom | \"BRIA background-removal model packaged for rembg (check license for commercial use).\" |\n\n## Missing Information\n\nThe webpage does not provide parameter counts, file sizes, training data details, architecture specifications, input resolutions, Hugging Face repository links, ONNX availability for each model, or performance comparisons between models. The page links to an evaluation card, comparison matrix, and benchmark hub for these details."}]},"uuid":"5af11e06-3b45-4296-928f-666261cc5ebd","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:07:14.624Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":66115,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Open Background Removal Models Summary\n\nBased on the webpage content, here are the open models listed:\n\n| Model | License | Details |\n|-------|---------|---------|\n| **withoutBG Open Weights** | Apache-2.0 | Self-host via Python, Docker, or Mac. Eval card and comparison data available. |\n| **U²-Net** | Apache-2.0 | \"Classic salient-object / background-removal network. Default model in many rembg setups.\" |\n| **U²-NetP** | Apache-2.0 | Lightweight variant described as optimized \"for faster CPU inference.\" |\n| **Silueta** | Apache-2.0 | \"Compact silhouette-oriented model shipped with rembg.\" |\n| **IS-Net (general use)** | Apache-2.0 | \"High-resolution dichotomous image segmentation model (DIS / IS-Net) for general cutouts.\" |\n| **BiRefNet General** | MIT | \"Bilateral Reference Network for high-quality dichotomous segmentation / matting-style cutouts.\" |\n| **BiRefNet General Lite** | MIT | Lighter checkpoint variant for enhanced speed. |\n| **BRIA RMBG** | Custom | \"BRIA background-removal model packaged for rembg (check license for commercial use).\" |\n\n## Missing Information\n\nThe webpage does not provide parameter counts, file sizes, training data details, architecture specifications, input resolutions, Hugging Face repository links, ONNX availability for each model, or performance comparisons between models. The page links to an evaluation card, comparison matrix, and benchmark hub for these details.","durationMs":4758,"url":"https://withoutbg.com/models"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"07fa0d7c-b029-4e3f-9be8-cb7328ff6ff7","session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
