{"parentUuid":"258206c0-b92b-4944-8e98-2eb94d3551c2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4236be89-a222-44d3-864f-75c76b867d88","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BAnyjtozExDxFbXkagQof1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"withoutbg open weights model huggingface Apache-2.0 background removal onnx size\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx · Discussions\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx/discussions\"},{\"title\":\"README.md · withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx at main\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx/blob/main/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - withoutbg/withoutbg: Image Background Removal Toolkit - Open Source and API Models · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/withoutbg/withoutbg\"},{\"title\":\"withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx · Hugging Face\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - withoutbg/withoutbg-python: Python SDK for local and cloud background removal (pip install withoutbg) · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/withoutbg/withoutbg-python\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - withoutbg/withoutbg-inference: Docker images and FastAPI service for the withoutBG open weights ONNX model (v3). · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/withoutbg/withoutbg-inference\"},{\"title\":\"ONNX background removal models | withoutBG\",\"url\":\"https://withoutbg.com/models/filter/onnx\"},{\"title\":\"Background Removal API and Open Model | withoutBG\",\"url\":\"https://withoutbg.com/\"},{\"title\":\"Open Background Removal Models | withoutBG\",\"url\":\"https://withoutbg.com/models\"},{\"title\":\"Python Package for Background Removal | withoutBG API Documentation\",\"url\":\"https://withoutbg.com/docs/open-weights-model/python\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about the WithoutBG open weights model:\n\n## Model Overview\n\nWithoutBG is an open-source background removal and alpha matting model from RGB images, with the OSS variant exported as a self-contained ONNX graph for ONNX Runtime.\n\n## Architecture\n\nThe graph includes DepthAnythingV2 and a ConvNeXt-fused matting head — no PyTorch checkpoints are needed at inference time. It runs depth estimation, segmentation, matting, and refinement in a single inference pass at up to 768px output resolution.\n\n## Model Size\n\nOn first call, WithoutBG.opensource() downloads ~320MB of ONNX weights from HuggingFace and caches them locally. Another source mentions weights come from Hugging Face on first local run (~455 MB).\n\n## License & Availability\n\nThe technology is licensed under Apache-2.0. Model weights are hosted on Hugging Face in ONNX format. The model is available at the Hugging Face repository: `withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx`.\n\n## Features\n\nThe Open Weights model runs entirely on your hardware with no API calls, no costs, and no data leaves your machine.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"e73f709b-193b-4d46-8270-b93f4a0b57e3","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:07:26.409Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"withoutbg open weights model huggingface Apache-2.0 background removal onnx size","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01PastMiFPthL4JgjnyFchY9","content":[{"title":"withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx · Discussions","url":"https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx/discussions"},{"title":"README.md · withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx at main","url":"https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx/blob/main/README.md"},{"title":"GitHub - withoutbg/withoutbg: Image Background Removal Toolkit - Open Source and API Models · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/withoutbg/withoutbg"},{"title":"withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx · Hugging Face","url":"https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx"},{"title":"GitHub - withoutbg/withoutbg-python: Python SDK for local and cloud background removal (pip install withoutbg) · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/withoutbg/withoutbg-python"},{"title":"GitHub - withoutbg/withoutbg-inference: Docker images and FastAPI service for the withoutBG open weights ONNX model (v3). · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/withoutbg/withoutbg-inference"},{"title":"ONNX background removal models | withoutBG","url":"https://withoutbg.com/models/filter/onnx"},{"title":"Background Removal API and Open Model | withoutBG","url":"https://withoutbg.com/"},{"title":"Open Background Removal Models | withoutBG","url":"https://withoutbg.com/models"},{"title":"Python Package for Background Removal | withoutBG API Documentation","url":"https://withoutbg.com/docs/open-weights-model/python"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about the WithoutBG open weights model:\n\n## Model Overview\n\nWithoutBG is an open-source background removal and alpha matting model from RGB images, with the OSS variant exported as a self-contained ONNX graph for ONNX Runtime.\n\n## Architecture\n\nThe graph includes DepthAnythingV2 and a ConvNeXt-fused matting head — no PyTorch checkpoints are needed at inference time. It runs depth estimation, segmentation, matting, and refinement in a single inference pass at up to 768px output resolution.\n\n## Model Size\n\nOn first call, WithoutBG.opensource() downloads ~320MB of ONNX weights from HuggingFace and caches them locally. Another source mentions weights come from Hugging Face on first local run (~455 MB).\n\n## License & Availability\n\nThe technology is licensed under Apache-2.0. Model weights are hosted on Hugging Face in ONNX format. The model is available at the Hugging Face repository: `withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx`.\n\n## Features\n\nThe Open Weights model runs entirely on your hardware with no API calls, no costs, and no data leaves your machine."],"durationSeconds":6.419895541999489,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUI