{"parentUuid":"2e39b279-0eaf-45e7-b90d-a8bdff5549dc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4236be89-a222-44d3-864f-75c76b867d88","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01S5WURBGqVrp4bYcUHPrBVJ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"BEN2 background erase network license commercial huggingface PramaLLC\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PramaLLC/BEN2 · Hugging Face\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2\"},{\"title\":\"README.md · PramaLLC/BEN2 at main\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/blob/main/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - PramaLLC/BEN2 · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/PramaLLC/BEN2/\"},{\"title\":\"PramaLLC/BEN2 at main\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/tree/main\"},{\"title\":\"PramaLLC/BEN2 · integrate with huggingface\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/discussions/3/files\"},{\"title\":\"integrate with huggingface · PramaLLC/BEN2 at 5ad69f0\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/commit/5ad69f0c63c1820bf9c9486fac0127ded199c980\"},{\"title\":\"README.md · PramaLLC/BEN2 at fe0c9f4a55992b6d7b059557af2078a81d6e60b1\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/blame/fe0c9f4a55992b6d7b059557af2078a81d6e60b1/README.md\"},{\"title\":\"BEN2 - a Hugging Face Space by PramaLLC\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/PramaLLC/BEN2\"},{\"title\":\"PramaLLC/BEN · Hugging Face\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN\"},{\"title\":\"Hugging Face\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/models?other=BEN2\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about BEN2:\n\n## BEN2 Overview\n\nBEN2 (Background Erase Network) introduces a novel approach to foreground segmentation through its innovative Confidence Guided Matting (CGM) pipeline. The architecture employs a refiner network that targets and processes pixels where the base model exhibits lower confidence levels, resulting in more precise and reliable matting results.\n\n## Training and Performance\n\nBEN2 was trained on the DIS5k and a 22K proprietary segmentation dataset. The enhanced model delivers superior performance in hair matting, 4K processing, object segmentation, and edge refinement.\n\n## Licensing and Availability\n\nThe model on Hugging Face is listed with an MIT license. The Base model is open source. However, for access to the commercial model, you can email sales@backgrounderase.com. Users can try the full model through a free web demo or integrate BEN2 into their project with an API.\n\nThe model is available on Hugging Face under the repository PramaLLC/BEN2, along with a demo space for testing.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"32cd3f1d-410a-46b4-aadc-ad4ac5c4af82","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:07:45.237Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"BEN2 background erase network license commercial huggingface PramaLLC","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Nej54EUPZz7EiiADVa64gK","content":[{"title":"PramaLLC/BEN2 · Hugging Face","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2"},{"title":"README.md · PramaLLC/BEN2 at main","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/blob/main/README.md"},{"title":"GitHub - PramaLLC/BEN2 · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/PramaLLC/BEN2/"},{"title":"PramaLLC/BEN2 at main","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/tree/main"},{"title":"PramaLLC/BEN2 · integrate with huggingface","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/discussions/3/files"},{"title":"integrate with huggingface · PramaLLC/BEN2 at 5ad69f0","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/commit/5ad69f0c63c1820bf9c9486fac0127ded199c980"},{"title":"README.md · PramaLLC/BEN2 at fe0c9f4a55992b6d7b059557af2078a81d6e60b1","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/blame/fe0c9f4a55992b6d7b059557af2078a81d6e60b1/README.md"},{"title":"BEN2 - a Hugging Face Space by PramaLLC","url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/PramaLLC/BEN2"},{"title":"PramaLLC/BEN · Hugging Face","url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN"},{"title":"Hugging Face","url":"https://huggingface.co/models?other=BEN2"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about BEN2:\n\n## BEN2 Overview\n\nBEN2 (Background Erase Network) introduces a novel approach to foreground segmentation through its innovative Confidence Guided Matting (CGM) pipeline. The architecture employs a refiner network that targets and processes pixels where the base model exhibits lower confidence levels, resulting in more precise and reliable matting results.\n\n## Training and Performance\n\nBEN2 was trained on the DIS5k and a 22K proprietary segmentation dataset. The enhanced model delivers superior performance in hair matting, 4K processing, object segmentation, and edge refinement.\n\n## Licensing and Availability\n\nThe model on Hugging Face is listed with an MIT license. The Base model is open source. However, for access to the commercial model, you can email sales@backgrounderase.com. Users can try the full model through a free web demo or integrate BEN2 into their project with an API.\n\nThe model is available on Hugging Face under the repository PramaLLC/BEN2, along with a demo space for testing."],"durationSeconds":5.693377167000436,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2e39b279-0eaf-45e7-b90d-a8bdff5549dc","session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
