{"parentUuid":"9f07443d-377d-4b98-b6b9-29daee48e828","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4236be89-a222-44d3-864f-75c76b867d88","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YWsNY44XhRtuhBmsnLsxE9","type":"tool_result","content":"# BEN2 Quick-Start Code\n\n## Installation\n```bash\npip install -e \"git+https://github.com/PramaLLC/BEN2.git#egg=ben2\"\n```\n\n## Imports and Inference\n```python\nfrom ben2 import BEN_Base\nfrom PIL import Image\nimport torch\n\ndevice = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n\nmodel = BEN_Base.from_pretrained(\"PramaLLC/BEN2\")\nmodel.to(device).eval()\n\nimage = Image.open(\"./image.png\")\nforeground = model.inference(image, refine_foreground=False)\nforeground.save(\"./foreground.png\")\n```\n\n## Output Type\nThe inference method returns a PIL Image object representing the segmented foreground with an alpha channel.\n\n## Additional Details\n- The repository is located at `https://github.com/PramaLLC/BEN2`\n- Model size information is not specified in the provided documentation\n- The `refine_foreground` parameter is described as \"an extract postprocessing step that increases inference time but can improve matting edges\""}]},"uuid":"934d0867-b04d-4cae-b06d-be307ff56769","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:09:09.080Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":129504,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# BEN2 Quick-Start Code\n\n## Installation\n```bash\npip install -e \"git+https://github.com/PramaLLC/BEN2.git#egg=ben2\"\n```\n\n## Imports and Inference\n```python\nfrom ben2 import BEN_Base\nfrom PIL import Image\nimport torch\n\ndevice = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n\nmodel = BEN_Base.from_pretrained(\"PramaLLC/BEN2\")\nmodel.to(device).eval()\n\nimage = Image.open(\"./image.png\")\nforeground = model.inference(image, refine_foreground=False)\nforeground.save(\"./foreground.png\")\n```\n\n## Output Type\nThe inference method returns a PIL Image object representing the segmented foreground with an alpha channel.\n\n## Additional Details\n- The repository is located at `https://github.com/PramaLLC/BEN2`\n- Model size information is not specified in the provided documentation\n- The `refine_foreground` parameter is described as \"an extract postprocessing step that increases inference time but can improve matting edges\"","durationMs":3516,"url":"https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2/blob/main/README.md"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9f07443d-377d-4b98-b6b9-29daee48e828","session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
