{"parentUuid":"5bdc0a5b-3442-47f7-858e-98c69b1f2fd3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14974778 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"951a4d38-fbaf-49fc-b3ff-067bfc510ce4","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:17:45.983Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14974778 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
{"parentUuid":"951a4d38-fbaf-49fc-b3ff-067bfc510ce4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf7RJyPhp2xUXUnhxMBNi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Searched and tested everything with a licence that doesn't touch our code (MIT / Apache-2.0). Ranked, all 34 photos:\n\n| Model | Licence | Weights | under 0.98 | mean | worst |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **BiRefNet** | MIT | ~420 MB | 7 | **0.982** | **0.864** |\n| InSPyReNet | MIT | ~350 MB | 8 | 0.980 | 0.820 |\n| **BiRefNet lite** | MIT | 115 MB fp16 | 7 | 0.979 | 0.827 |\n| BiRefNet massive | MIT | ~420 MB | 7 | 0.978 | 0.817 |\n| ISNet general-use | Apache-2 | 170 MB | **4** | 0.974 | **0.428** ← same brain as imgly: perfect on garments, hollows out white/blue sneakers |\n| BEN2 base | MIT | ~360 MB | 9 | 0.973 | 0.814 |\n| u2netp (shipped) | Apache-2 | 4.6 MB | 10 | 0.972 | 0.801 |\n| withoutBG open | Apache-2 | ~320 MB | 8 | 0.968 | 0.740 (halo on Kilian) |\n| SAM 2.1 base+ | Apache-2 | 300 MB | 13 | 0.958 | 0.594 |\n| U²-Net full / Silueta | Apache-2 | 170 / 43 MB | 8 / 11 | 0.949 / 0.946 | 0.17 (both kill the bottle) |\n\nNot runnable: RMBG-1.4/2.0 (Bria custom licence, non-commercial — out regardless), ormbg (humans only), BiRefNet HR (2K, minutes per image).\n\nOne correction to my earlier read: on the blue AJ1 (zoom row 4) it's **u2netp that wins** (0.989); imgly and ISNet are the ones hollowing it out. I had that backwards.\n\nWhat the sheet shows:\n- Nothing beats **BiRefNet** on the hard cases (bottle, chain). Every other MIT model is within ~0.01 of it on plain garments — you won't see a difference there.\n- **ISNet (Apache)** is the \"imgly without AGPL\" option: best garment count (4 under bar) but the 0.43 sneaker failure is a real product bug, not a metric artefact.\n- **BiRefNet lite** stays the practical pick: 115 MB, same under-bar count as full, MIT, only loses to full on the Angels' Share bottle.\n\nDecision for you: **lite (115 MB, WebGPU-only, u2netp fallback)** or **keep u2netp (4.6 MB, works everywhere)**. Full BiRefNet at 420 MB isn't a phone download.\n\nSources: [withoutBG model list](https://withoutbg.com/models), [withoutBG open weights](https://huggingface.co/withoutbg/withoutbg-openweights-onnx), [BEN2](https://huggingface.co/PramaLLC/BEN2), [invideo comparison](https://invideo.io/blog/ai-background-removal-models/)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1021,"cache_read_input_tokens":143551,"output_tokens":1079,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1021,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1079,"cache_read_input_tokens":143551,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1021,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1021},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf7RJvR7PDe5uuW3nQjK8","type":"assistant","uuid":"3e7d6977-c767-4d17-a48a-bceb79409272","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:18:01.406Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
