{"parentUuid":"ea964324-3bc7-417a-a101-f5046ad7358f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf7SxWTPQqHPqxFq4rcxD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"One bug caught while making this: the harness overwrote `scratch/ours` on every `FROM_DIR` run, so the \"u2netp\" column in the previous round-2 sheets was actually Silueta (the label-only bottle). Fixed in `run.mjs:117`, u2netp regenerated, sheets rebuilt. The numbers in the tables were always right (scored from separate JSONs); only that image column was wrong.\n\nWhere you'll actually see a difference, u2netp → lite:\n- **Black trousers (row 3)**: 0.889 → 0.997 — u2netp shaves the hem/waist edge.\n- **White shirt on white (row 6)**: 0.924 → 0.985 — u2netp eats the cuffs.\n- **Black knit (row 7)**: 0.971 → 0.994 — sleeves.\n- **Chain**: 0.801 → 0.860 — links are cleaner, still not perfect.\n- **Angels' Share**: lite *loses* here (0.915 → 0.827, drops the bottom of the bottle).\n\nEverything else is within 0.01 — same at phone size."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":153709,"output_tokens":367,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":367,"cache_read_input_tokens":153709,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf7SxSxYZmYyNpG8sWSBG","type":"assistant","uuid":"9fc8c0f1-372a-491a-820b-2f4cc943baa9","timestamp":"2026-09-16T16:39:29.051Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"s