{"parentUuid":"5e93ccfe-301f-405d-b201-f11581d290bd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14923504 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9af1af4c-4b4f-4984-b135-4cdb011d3de2","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:14:32.054Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n<total_tokens>14923504 tokens left</total_tokens>\n</system-reminder>"}],"session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
{"parentUuid":"9af1af4c-4b4f-4984-b135-4cdb011d3de2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf7Ve5Ew7qxTTNHjfEUEQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer to your question, measured, not guessed:\n\n**BiRefNet lite in the browser — it works now**, after two fixes to the export (deformable conv rewritten as GridSample steps; wide Split/Concat trees):\n\n| | u2netp (shipped) | BiRefNet lite @512 |\n|---|---|---|\n| time / image, this Mac, WASM | 0.3 s | **1.1 s** (first image 2.4 s) |\n| WASM memory | 150 MB | **1.3 GB** |\n| download | 4.6 MB | 194 MB (fp32) |\n| quality (34 photos) | 10 under bar / worst 0.80 | 7 under bar / worst 0.81 |\n\nTwo hard facts:\n- **512 px is the floor.** At 384/448 the model collapses (IoU 0.00 / 0.03 on some photos). At 768/1024 it's no better than 512. So 512 it is.\n- **1.3 GB is the architecture, not a bug.** PyTorch needs the same (two backbone passes + full-res concats). I tried arena/planner flags, `.ort` format, memory-lean convs — nothing moves it. On a phone: expect 3–8 s per image, and mid/older phones may kill the tab. I can't verify that from the Simulator; it needs a real iPhone.\n\nGiven that, an option I dismissed too early: **run BiRefNet (the full one, best quality) on a GPU server.** ~1 s, ~$0.001/image — a 100-item closet ≈ 10¢, less than the Haiku tagging we already pay. And the photo *already* leaves the device for tagging, so privacy doesn't change.\n\nYour call:\n- **A.** In-browser lite @512, u2netp as fallback when it OOMs — free, but needs a real-phone test before I'd trust it.\n- **B.** Server-side full BiRefNet — guaranteed, best quality, ~$0.001/image."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":733,"cache_read_input_tokens":248259,"output_tokens":641,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":733,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":641,"cache_read_input_tokens":248259,"cache_creation_input_tokens":733,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":733},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf7Ve1L2b7raSV7ZWGG55","type":"assistant","uuid":"fd7c9a46-1625-4bfe-9ef1-660be9ef5045","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:14:42.963Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
