{"parentUuid":"f5a9ffb7-18ed-4ef3-b429-455ebbc35f02","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0e509fe1-2cde-47e5-88ff-217435c2c5f0","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H7fPHU5dEBMkSZe5K3Bsbw","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Modal.com serverless GPU region selection EU GDPR data processing agreement 2026\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Best Cloud GPU Providers in 2026 | Modal\",\"url\":\"https://modal.com/resources/best-cloud-gpu-providers\"},{\"title\":\"Best On-Demand GPU Platforms in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://modal.com/resources/best-on-demand-gpu-platforms\"},{\"title\":\"Introducing: Region selection\",\"url\":\"https://modal.com/blog/region-selection-launch\"},{\"title\":\"Modal Pricing and Alternatives: GPU vs. CPU Infrastructure | Blaxel\",\"url\":\"https://blaxel.ai/blog/modal-pricing-alternatives-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Modal Pricing Guide: Plans, Costs & Real Examples - Modal\",\"url\":\"https://checkthat.ai/brands/modal/pricing\"},{\"title\":\"How Much Does Modal Cost? 2026 Per-Second GPU Pricing | Markaicode\",\"url\":\"https://markaicode.com/pricing/modal-pricing/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's what I found about Modal.com's serverless GPU region selection and EU/GDPR compliance:\n\n## Region Selection\n\nModal now allows you to select which cloud region you'd like your Functions to run in, with regions available from around the world. Specifying region=\"eu\" will ensure that Functions run within EU datacenters. Cloud region selection is available on the Team plan (for limited CPU use cases) and the Enterprise plan.\n\n## EU/GDPR Compliance\n\nYour company may be subject to local regulation around where user data can be processed; GDPR, for example, places strict guardrails on when user data can leave the EU.\n\n## Pricing for EU Regions\n\nRegion selection applies a 1.5x–1.75x multiplier to the whole container's per-second cost — GPU, CPU, and memory together — whenever a specific region is requested. Additionally, a healthcare startup requiring EU data residency for GDPR compliance, running production inference with guaranteed availability, could see a workload costing $1,000/month on default US preemptible infrastructure increase to $6,000/month with EU compliance AND guaranteed execution.\n\nThe search results don't contain specific information about Modal's formal data processing agreements for 2026, so I'd recommend contacting Modal directly at support@modal.com for the most current information about their EU data processing terms.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"2cc46f9a-6da3-44eb-941c-10f34581a1f1","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:16:31.959Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Modal.com serverless GPU region selection EU GDPR data processing agreement 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Mqix4gaV26cfRgdv9HnSit","content":[{"title":"Best Cloud GPU Providers in 2026 | Modal","url":"https://modal.com/resources/best-cloud-gpu-providers"},{"title":"Best On-Demand GPU Platforms in 2026","url":"https://modal.com/resources/best-on-demand-gpu-platforms"},{"title":"Introducing: Region selection","url":"https://modal.com/blog/region-selection-launch"},{"title":"Modal Pricing and Alternatives: GPU vs. CPU Infrastructure | Blaxel","url":"https://blaxel.ai/blog/modal-pricing-alternatives-guide"},{"title":"Modal Pricing Guide: Plans, Costs & Real Examples - Modal","url":"https://checkthat.ai/brands/modal/pricing"},{"title":"How Much Does Modal Cost? 2026 Per-Second GPU Pricing | Markaicode","url":"https://markaicode.com/pricing/modal-pricing/"}]},"Based on the search results, here's what I found about Modal.com's serverless GPU region selection and EU/GDPR compliance:\n\n## Region Selection\n\nModal now allows you to select which cloud region you'd like your Functions to run in, with regions available from around the world. Specifying region=\"eu\" will ensure that Functions run within EU datacenters. Cloud region selection is available on the Team plan (for limited CPU use cases) and the Enterprise plan.\n\n## EU/GDPR Compliance\n\nYour company may be subject to local regulation around where user data can be processed; GDPR, for example, places strict guardrails on when user data can leave the EU.\n\n## Pricing for EU Regions\n\nRegion selection applies a 1.5x–1.75x multiplier to the whole container's per-second cost — GPU, CPU, and memory together — whenever a specific region is requested. Additionally, a healthcare startup requiring EU data residency for GDPR compliance, running production inference with guaranteed availability, could see a workload costing $1,000/month on default US preemptible infrastructure increase to $6,000/month with EU compliance AND guaranteed execution.\n\nThe search results don't contain specific information about Modal's formal data processing agreements for 2026, so I'd recommend contacting Modal directly at support@modal.com for the most current information about their EU data processing terms."],"durationSeconds":6.921678083999082,"searchCount":1},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f5a9ffb7-18ed-4ef3-b429-455ebbc35f02","session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
