{"parentUuid":"03f28298-63d7-42e2-8db9-fc0607af826f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"90002370-bd6c-45b1-8b46-b55760afaf78","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Q6UUZX2hEy7LQyN1Qp6b2G","type":"tool_result","content":"# BiRefNet Background Removal V2 - Technical Specifications\n\n## Endpoint & Model\n- **URL**: `https://fal.run/fal-ai/birefnet/v2`\n- **Model ID**: `fal-ai/birefnet/v2`\n- **Category**: Image-to-image inference\n\n## Performance Metrics\nNo inference time, latency, or speed specifications are documented in the provided content.\n\n## Input Specifications\n\n**Required Parameter:**\n- `image_url` (string): \"URL of the image to remove background from\"\n\n**Optional Parameters:**\n- `model`: Six variants available (Light, Light 2K, Heavy, Matting, Portrait, Dynamic)\n- `operating_resolution`: \"1024x1024\" (default), 2048x2048, or 2304x2304\n- `output_format`: PNG (default), WebP, or GIF\n- `refine_foreground`: Boolean toggle (enabled by default)\n- `output_mask`: Boolean for mask output\n- `mask_only`: Boolean to return segmentation mask only\n- `sync_mode`: Boolean for data URI return\n\n## Output Schema\n\n**Primary Output:**\n- `image`: An ImageFile object containing the processed result with height, width, URL, filename, and content type\n\n**Optional Output:**\n- `mask_image`: The segmentation mask used for background removal\n\nSupported resolutions range from 256x256 to 2304x2304 for the Dynamic model variant."}]},"uuid":"8cb77735-6182-47c1-93ef-d81d82b145e5","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:22:05.402Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":7028,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# BiRefNet Background Removal V2 - Technical Specifications\n\n## Endpoint & Model\n- **URL**: `https://fal.run/fal-ai/birefnet/v2`\n- **Model ID**: `fal-ai/birefnet/v2`\n- **Category**: Image-to-image inference\n\n## Performance Metrics\nNo inference time, latency, or speed specifications are documented in the provided content.\n\n## Input Specifications\n\n**Required Parameter:**\n- `image_url` (string): \"URL of the image to remove background from\"\n\n**Optional Parameters:**\n- `model`: Six variants available (Light, Light 2K, Heavy, Matting, Portrait, Dynamic)\n- `operating_resolution`: \"1024x1024\" (default), 2048x2048, or 2304x2304\n- `output_format`: PNG (default), WebP, or GIF\n- `refine_foreground`: Boolean toggle (enabled by default)\n- `output_mask`: Boolean for mask output\n- `mask_only`: Boolean to return segmentation mask only\n- `sync_mode`: Boolean for data URI return\n\n## Output Schema\n\n**Primary Output:**\n- `image`: An ImageFile object containing the processed result with height, width, URL, filename, and content type\n\n**Optional Output:**\n- `mask_image`: The segmentation mask used for background removal\n\nSupported resolutions range from 256x256 to 2304x2304 for the Dynamic model variant.","durationMs":4809,"url":"https://fal.ai/models/fal-ai/birefnet/v2/llms.txt"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"03f28298-63d7-42e2-8db9-fc0607af826f","session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/Fitcheck","sessionId":"8dbc8706-da4b-488c-b8be-7203d3d08172","version":"2.1.273","gitBranch":"feat/cutout-refinement","slug":"groovy-floating-penguin"}
