{"parentUuid":"b00955b8-5190-436c-b69f-a90bc480f687","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf7WDW2NMgqLXTerVSHd3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Estimated per image, phone → fal → back, based on their $0.0008/s billing and typical fal latency (I can't measure without an API key):\n\n| step | time |\n|---|---|\n| compress + upload photo (~300 KB) | 0.3–1 s |\n| fal queue + BiRefNet inference @1024 | ~1–2 s |\n| download cutout PNG | 0.3–0.5 s |\n| **total** | **~2–4 s** |\n\nFor comparison:\n- u2netp on device today: 0.3–1 s\n- BiRefNet lite in-browser: 3–8 s (estimate) + 194 MB first download + the memory risk\n\nTwo things that make it feel faster than the number:\n- Multi-item upload runs in parallel — 5 items ≈ 4 s, not 20.\n- We already wait for Haiku tagging (~2–3 s) after the cutout; both calls can run at the same time on the server, so the user-visible wait barely grows over today.\n\nI'll measure real numbers on the first image once you've created a fal account and put `FAL_KEY` in `.env.local`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":901,"cache_read_input_tokens":257120,"output_tokens":358,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":901,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":358,"cache_read_input_tokens":257120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":901,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":901},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cf7WDRM527BLvZNofRT9u","type":"assistant","uuid":"d7118e10-fb67-43d2-b518-dd68c98fae9c","timestamp":"2026-09-16T17:22:12.965Z","effort":"h