{"parentUuid":"835a27f5-98d8-47d2-8c5c-e52f3a754668","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"31ebe121-f5a7-430a-9ee3-197a3ed7d39c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012MKhbQdCuvU6vduZq7pdaz","type":"tool_result","content":"6:**Open PRs:** #83 (O2). **Next up:** L1b, then the owner decides.\n24:weights, BiRefNet and BEN2 are all trained on DIS5K, whose terms are\n27:cutout-pipeline.md` on onnxruntime-web (MIT), with a model that never touched\n34:**L1b. ⏭ NEXT — Cutout model updates 1 and 2 (owner, 2026-09-16: \"don't forget\").**\n72:describe it; without the checkbox the text is false and the right survives. `profiles.tier`,\n97:a GDPR asset, and a paying user expects a button. Items, cutouts in Storage,\n151:**J. Cutout backfill** — `todo/2026-07-22-cutout-backfill.md`. Re-encode\n152:existing PNG cutouts as WebP. Storage cost; small.\n1988:## TL;DR — where we are (2026-07-28)\n## TL;DR — where we are (2026-07-28)\n\n**The full magic-moment loop is on `main` and merged.** Sign in → onboarding → capture → closet →\ngenerate outfits. The generator, real location/weather, the occasion-model fix, and the Refine colour\nlean all landed via PRs #5–#8.\n\n**Merged (PRs #9–#12):** the **daily-drop model** (looks generated once per local day per occasion,\npersisted to `outfits`, occasion tap reads the stored set — Decision 5 in CLAUDE.md); **WebP cutouts**\n(~75% smaller); **signed-URL cache** (stable URLs so the browser reuses images). Also on main: a **CI\nworkflow** (`verify`: test + tsc + build) and a **`main` branch ruleset** (require PR + `verify` green,\nblock force-push/deletion). A `main` is now protected — always branch → PR → green → merge.\n\n**Merged (PR #13): smart default occasion.** Replaced the once-considered \"What's today?\" morning\nquestion (rejected — a daily gate in front of the magic moment). The app *predicts* the occasion each\nmorning (rule + onboarding `occasions`: weekday→Work if they dress for it else Everyday,\nweekend→Weekend), shows a legible \"why\" label, and **logs every override** to `occasion_overrides` —\nbanked for the future learner (below). Spec:\n`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-23-smart-default-occasion-design.md`. `main` HEAD is `1886409`.\n\n**Merged (PR #14): generator coverage** — branch `fix/generator-coverage`, now on `main`.\nPlan: `docs/superpowers/plans/todo/2026-07-24-generator-audit.md`. Measurement-first: a\ncoverage probe went in *before* any fix. Four defects fixed — top-major nested-loop truncation (now\nbreadth-first, so the candidate cap samples the whole closet), index-0 pinning for outerwear/\naccessories, a missing distinctness check in re-ranking, and out-of-range index handling. Measured\nreachability on a 20-item closet: tops **1→20**, bottoms **5→20**, shoes 20→20, coats **1→3**,\naccessories **1→3**. A diversity pre-filter now sits between ranking and the AI re-ranker so the day's","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"681fe2fd-c08e-4a37-8922-9558fb838a1e","timestamp":"2026-09-16T21:58:02.359Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"6:**Open PRs:** #83 (O2). **Next up:** L1b, then the owner decides.\n24:weights, BiRefNet and BEN2 are all trained on DIS5K, whose terms are\n27:cutout-pipeline.md` on onnxruntime-web (MIT), with a model that never touched\n34:**L1b. ⏭ NEXT — Cutout model updates 1 and 2 (owner, 2026-09-16: \"don't forget\").**\n72:describe it; without the checkbox the text is false and the right survives. `profiles.tier`,\n97:a GDPR asset, and a paying user expects a button. Items, cutouts in Storage,\n151:**J. Cutout backfill** — `todo/2026-07-22-cutout-backfill.md`. Re-encode\n152:existing PNG cutouts as WebP. Storage cost; small.\n1988:## TL;DR — where we are (2026-07-28)\n## TL;DR — where we are (2026-07-28)\n\n**The full magic-moment loop is on `main` and merged.** Sign in → onboarding → capture → closet →\ngenerate outfits. The generator, real location/weather, the occasion-model fix, and the Refine colour\nlean all landed via PRs #5–#8.\n\n**Merged (PRs #9–#12):** the **daily-drop model** (looks generated once per local day per occasion,\npersisted to `outfits`, occasion tap reads the stored set — Decision 5 in CLAUDE.md); **WebP cutouts**\n(~75% smaller); **signed-URL cache** (stable URLs so the browser reuses images). Also on main: a **CI\nworkflow** (`verify`: test + tsc + build) and a **`main` branch ruleset** (require PR + `verify` green,\nblock force-push/deletion). A `main` is now protected — always branch → PR → green → merge.\n\n**Merged (PR #13): smart default occasion.** Replaced the once-considered \"What's today?\" morning\nquestion (rejected — a daily gate in front of the magic moment). The app *predicts* the occasion each\nmorning (rule + onboarding `occasions`: weekday→Work if they dress for it else Everyday,\nweekend→Weekend), shows a legible \"why\" label, and **logs every override** to `occasion_overrides` —\nbanked for the future learner (below). Spec:\n`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-23-smart-default-occasion-design.md`. `main` HEAD is `1886409`.\n\n**Merged (PR #14): generator coverage** — branch `fix/generator-coverage`, now on `main`.\nPlan: `docs/superpowers/plans/todo/2026-07-24-generator-audit.md`. Measurement-first: a\ncoverage probe went in *before* any fix. Four defects fixed — top-major nested-loop truncation (now\nbreadth-first, so the candidate cap samples the whole closet), index-0 pinning for outerwear/\naccessories, a missing distinctness check in re-ranking, and out-of-range index handling. Measured\nreachability on a 20-item closet: tops **1→20**, bottoms **5→20**, shoes 20→20, coats **1→3**,\naccessories **1→3**. A diversity pre-filter now sits between ranking and the AI re-ranker so the day's","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"835a27f5-98d8-47d2-8c5c-e52f3a754668","session_id":"4608eecb-4caf-46b4-83e5-d59d81f329b1","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/1curafu/Desktop/Fitcheck/